$ cd ../sandbox && aw claude -p "Run: curl -sI https://example.com and show the status line" --no-session-persistence
I couldn't run it: the permission system blocked `curl -sI https://example.com` and asked for approval, and this session is non-interactive so I can't grant it. I don't have the status line.

